omp-minimizer attribution notice
================================

This crate ports the shell-output minimizer of oh-my-pi's `pi-shell` crate
(`crates/pi-shell/src/minimizer`, pinned at commit
88a69582c755bd000e8dc0290981fc787a4f400c).

Upstream project: https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi
